 "note": "Scope tags for Cedwyn's webapps (1 Nov 2026). Read by /_cedwyn/scope.js on every page. 'home' = the scope a whole webapp belongs to (all = every scope; wales = on-the-ground visits in Wales; argentina = the planned replica in Patagonia; online = online-only). 'blocks' tag parts of a page by CSS selector (+ optional 'text' it must contain); 'pages' do the same for a path prefix. Untagged = all, so nothing disappears. Spec: docs/SCOPES.md.",
